# Git-ignored files Claude Code copies from the source checkout into each new
# worktree (.gitignore syntax; a file is copied only if it matches here AND is
# git-ignored). Keep to local config that is not regenerable — never build
# output, node_modules, logs or test runs.

# Per-developer agent settings and rules — CLAUDE.md imports it.
AGENTS.local.md

# Local secrets and config every local entry point loads (--env-file-if-exists).
# Not regenerable: the address-hash key is generated once and must match the
# compose Postgres every checkout shares.
.env.local
